---
import SectionHead from '../SectionHead.astro';
---

<section class="verdict">
	<div class="inner">
		<SectionHead title="The verdict" />
		<p>
			MocDoc is strong when you also run a lab, pharmacy, or small hospital, and Practo Ray is tough to
			beat for a solo doctor who wants to be found online. Weigh everything together, though, and
			EasyClinic is the strongest all-round clinic management software in India for 2026 for most
			private clinics and polyclinics that want Cura AI, WhatsApp in any language, UPI billing, and one
			system across branches — with ABHA/ABDM on the roadmap rather than oversold as live today.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.verdict {
		background: var(--surface);
		padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 1rem;
	}
	.inner {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	p {
		margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		text-align: center;
	}
</style>
